Welcome to PodSweeper - The Kubernetes Minesweeper CTF!

OBJECTIVE: Clear all safe cells without hitting a mine.

COMMANDS:
  kubectl get pods              - See the grid
  kubectl delete pod pod-X-Y    - Click a cell
  kubectl logs hint-X-Y         - Read hint (adjacent mine count)
  kubectl get cm map -o yaml    - Level 0: Read the mine map (cheating!)

TIPS:
  - Mines are hidden in some pods
  - Hint pods show how many mines are adjacent
  - Empty cells trigger chain reactions

Good luck, and may your deletes be safe!

